From: UniXNU contributors
Subject: [PATCH] k60: publish only a pinned early PAS1 GLINK owner lease

Missing platform ownership is a dependency failure, never a synthetic lease.
The live publisher references the kernel existing-only serializer and never
allocates or resets DSP rings. Early and late PAS attempts share one claim.

